<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第二幕 · 模型外面那一圈里头</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>把「对错」变成机器能判的关卡</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "stretch", height: 150}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>工具调用</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8}}>模型说它要做什么</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 34, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.30)"}}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>协议检查</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8}}>形状、参数、权限对不对</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 34, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.30)"}}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>验证门禁</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8}}>测试 / lint / 类型跑一遍</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 34, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.30)"}}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>放行 / 拒绝</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8}}>不过就不许往下</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "stretch", marginTop: 26}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#0F6E56"}}>位置原则</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 10}}>在错误离源头最近的地方就地拦下。</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#0F6E56"}}>可执行契约</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 10}}>把测试当成契约——写了测试，「对错」就从讨论变成了运行。</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>与人自觉的区别</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 10}}>门禁不累、不变、不看心情。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>14 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
